Create a complete mobile app UI/UX design for a personal growth and wellness streaming platform called **Mentex**.

The app is similar to Netflix but focused on mental development, meditation, knowledge, and inspirational content.

The design must be modern, minimal, elegant, and slightly futuristic, with a calm and premium feeling. Use soft gradients, clean typography, and smooth spacing. The UI should feel immersive and focused on learning and inner growth.

Primary audience: people interested in self-improvement, meditation, entrepreneurship, philosophy, and personal development.

Primary colors:

* Deep dark background
* Soft glowing accents
* Calm gradients (blue, purple, subtle gold)

Design a full mobile application (Android first) including the following screens:

1. ONBOARDING
   A welcome screen introducing Mentex.
   Headline: "Train your mind every day"
   Short description explaining that users can access:
   • Meditations
   • Book learnings
   • Inspirational biographies
   • Stories of great companies
   • Reflections and mental training

Include buttons:

* Get Started
* Login

Second onboarding screen: select interests
Options:
Meditation
Personal growth
Business
Philosophy
Productivity
Inspirational stories

2. HOME SCREEN
   Navigation bar at the bottom with:
   Home | Explore | Library | Progress | Profile

Home layout structure:

Top bar:
Profile icon (left)
Mentex logo (center)
Search icon (right)

Main sections:

Featured Banner
Large cinematic banner highlighting a series or content.

Continue Watching
Horizontal carousel of videos in progress.

Recommended For You
Personalized video suggestions.

Meditations
Horizontal video carousel.

Book Learnings
Horizontal carousel.

Biographies
Horizontal carousel.

3. EXPLORE SCREEN
   Search bar at the top.

Content categories displayed as large cards:

