Long-form meditations

Monthly plan option:
$9.99 per month

Buttons:

Start Premium
Continue with Free plan (2 videos per week)

Design the UI as a modern streaming platform similar to Netflix but focused on knowledge, mindfulness, and personal evolution.

Use smooth spacing, modern card-based layouts, horizontal carousels for videos, and immersive visual hierarchy optimized for mobile devices.
